From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:59:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let users edit scraped metadata, and keep their edits

MetadataOverrides stores what the user edited (title, plot, rating,
year, age rating, season/episode numbers) on the device. Edits update
the library at once and are applied again on every MovieTags,
EpisodeTags and ShowTags save, so automatic scrapes, rescrape all and
NFO imports never undo them.
